{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b14ab9e0e4382df9415d543c0b07ed79.avif?t=1771494782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/b14ab9e0e4382df9415d543c0b07ed79.avif?t=1771494782 width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lami: A Cup of Code &amp; Coffee</strong> is a 3D casual game that blends Japanese aesthetics with caf\u00e9 &amp; workshop management, and rhythm gameplay. The story follows a young protagonist who, feeling disenchanted with their mundane life, receives a letter from their late grandfather asking them to take over his caf\u00e9. Intrigued, the protagonist quits their job and heads to the caf\u00e9, only to discover a hidden research lab on the upper floor, where an AI robot girl named Lami awakens. It turns out that Lami was developed by the protagonist\u2019s grandfather, and now, together with Lami, they embark on a new life managing the caf\u00e9. What challenges await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/e95ec2dfd6c5a253c6bf618b838f8ec2.avif?t=1771494782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/e95ec2dfd6c5a253c6bf618b838f8ec2.avif?t=1771494782 width=800 height=91 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2615Run a coffee shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a cafe with Lami, move around the cafe, use different furniture and equipment, and quickly complete customers' orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe1Customized decoration to create a unique space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your dream cafe! Place the furniture and decorate, it's all up to you. Different furnishings will also affect the effect of the cafe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2328\ufe0f Code to the Beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique rhythm game where you &quot;write code&quot; in sync with the beat, upgrading Lami's abilities in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd29 Invent, Craft &amp; Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, build new furniture, upgrade Lami, and unlock new tools to enhance the caf\u00e9 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to Take on the Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Lami by your side, uncover your grandfather\u2019s hidden secrets and bring the caf\u00e9 back to life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196150?t=1771494782","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196150?t=1771494782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/21dbbfe499f3767efb15908daa0ee7b6418cab09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771494782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/21dbbfe499f3767efb15908daa0ee7b6418cab09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771494782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3900520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b14ab9e0e4382df9415d543c0b07ed79.avif?t=1771494782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/b14ab9e0e4382df9415d543c0b07ed79.avif?t=1771494782 width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lami: A Cup of Code &amp; Coffee</strong> is a 3D casual game that blends Japanese aesthetics with caf\u00e9 &amp; workshop management, and rhythm gameplay. The story follows a young protagonist who, feeling disenchanted with their mundane life, receives a letter from their late grandfather asking them to take over his caf\u00e9. Intrigued, the protagonist quits their job and heads to the caf\u00e9, only to discover a hidden research lab on the upper floor, where an AI robot girl named Lami awakens. It turns out that Lami was developed by the protagonist\u2019s grandfather, and now, together with Lami, they embark on a new life managing the caf\u00e9. What challenges await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/e95ec2dfd6c5a253c6bf618b838f8ec2.avif?t=1771494782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/e95ec2dfd6c5a253c6bf618b838f8ec2.avif?t=1771494782 width=800 height=91 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2615Run a coffee shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a cafe with Lami, move around the cafe, use different furniture and equipment, and quickly complete customers' orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe1Customized decoration to create a unique space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your dream cafe! Place the furniture and decorate, it's all up to you. Different furnishings will also affect the effect of the cafe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2328\ufe0f Code to the Beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique rhythm game where you &quot;write code&quot; in sync with the beat, upgrading Lami's abilities in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd29 Invent, Craft &amp; Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, build new furniture, upgrade Lami, and unlock new tools to enhance the caf\u00e9 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.poster.avif?t=1771494782\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.webm?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.mp4?t=1771494782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to Take on the Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Lami by your side, uncover your grandfather\u2019s hidden secrets and bring the caf\u00e9 back to life!</p>","developers":["Lemist Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/header.jpg?t=1771494782","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3196150/862905/c47a75118f0c4e110e076740a42336d8999ae3f3/1750879925/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743665298","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3196150/862905/c47a75118f0c4e110e076740a42336d8999ae3f3/1750879925/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743665298","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3196150/862905/c47a75118f0c4e110e076740a42336d8999ae3f3/1750879925/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743665298","id":257121673,"name":"Official Game Trailer - English ver","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121673/99c7541831515e55cf2f1c20123459157832c8fa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743665298"}],"name":"Lami: A Cup of Code and Coffee","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 33